### Demais Módulos (Audio, Bit, CLI, Chronometry, Compression, Concurrency, Logging, Math, Network, Parsing, Struct, Type)
- Conforme varredura, remover macros manuais `*_PROTOTYPE`, adotar X-macros obrigatórios para enums e declarar via `PACKAGE`/`OBJECT`.
